# Device invite

- Payload: `tandem-device:` + base64url `{ v:1, u, r, p }` — **includes PAT**, never master password.
- Setup invite path skips password confirm; partner types shared password separately.
- UI must keep “don’t screenshot / leave on screen” warnings.
- Do not put invite strings in URLs, logs, README examples, or commits.
